    "natural": "Remove flower_cherry background pass only when trees_cherry is replaced; 25% wisteria selection per original attempt. One wisteria-specific 48-attempt radius-5 ground pass per successful wisteria; ordinary cherry uses loaded Nemo decorator when present, otherwise same bounded pass with Pink Petals. No fallback patch replacement.",
