    "scope": "Clone loaded tree/fallen-tree parameters. Selection and placement graphs derive from inspected vanilla 26.2; inspected Matcha pack changes biome climate/mobs/colors but retains the relevant feature keys. Unrecognized replacement feature keys are not guessed."
  },
