    "observed_mapping": "Explicit vanilla leaf block names and upper-half foliage states; no #minecraft:leaves rule. Mere block tags cannot supply a shader material assignment.",
    "implementation": "Optional client Iris RETURN hook adds only absent Silver Birch leaf states from corresponding loaded vanilla Birch Leaves states, and only absent Wisteria states from corresponding vanilla Cherry Leaves states. Explicit custom mappings, including non-waving mappings, win. No shader material IDs, shader file edits, geometry animation, or unrelated block changes are hardcoded. Existing native leaf classes, tags, properties and alpha-derived rendering are retained.",
    "target": "net.irisshaders.iris.shaderpack.materialmap.BlockMaterialMapping#createBlockStateIdMap",
    "descriptor": "(Lit/unimi/dsi/fastutil/ints/Int2ObjectLinkedOpenHashMap;Lit/unimi/dsi/fastutil/ints/Int2ObjectLinkedOpenHashMap;)Lit/unimi/dsi/fastutil/objects/Object2IntMap;",
