    "wind_entry": "shaders/lib/materials/materialMethods/wavingBlocks.glsl",
    "wind_dispatch": "The corresponding loaded vanilla Birch Leaves material is used only when a custom Silver Birch state is absent, retaining the shader pack's normal leaf-specific waving path. The current color value is intentionally compensated separately rather than by changing shader classification.",
